  "rationale": [
    "Adopt execution semantics that strengthen deterministic safety, resumability, observability and interoperability without importing a parallel agent framework.",
    "Retain existing FA3 authorities for durable orchestration, model routing, tools, security, resources, evidence, memory and deployment.",
    "Do not adopt automatic cross-provider model failover here because provider execution and credential-aware routing are separately governed.",
    "Treat upstream ADK code and release metadata as REFERENCE_ONLY; implementation is FA3-native."
